\series default
 introduces the Context Ensemble Local Learning (CELL) formalism and details the iterative development of two specific instantiations:
 oCELL,
 which spatializes the local experts with orthotopes and kCELL,
 which introduces more interactive social learning rules and smoother spatialization through the use of radial basis functions to produce more faithful data representations.
 These models provide the foundational learning capabilities and the introspection metrics used in following chapters.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize

