reference "sec:CELL-Formalism"
plural "false"
caps "false"
noprefix "false"
nolink "false"

\end_inset

 presents the CELL formalism by defining the core components and social mechanisms of a multi-agent system based on an ensemble of local expert agents.
 From this theoretical foundation,
 Section 
