caps "false"
noprefix "false"
nolink "false"

\end_inset

 introduces the learning rules that govern the self-organizing behavior of the agents,
 leading to the emergence of learning from the ensemble.
 Section 
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
LatexCommand ref
reference "subsec:kCELL-Online-Stationary-Modeling"
plural "false"
caps "false"
noprefix "false"
nolink "false"

\end_inset

