 It can be noted that in the initial 20000 steps,
 kCELL has a higher RMSE and MAE than all other algorithms.
 However,
 the RMSE and MAE decrease consistently as more data is processed.
 kCELL's error curve crosses the others at approximately 25000 steps for MAE and 35000 steps for RMSE.
 As shown in Table 
