 are respectively the mass,
 length and angle of the pole,
 
\begin_inset Formula $m_{\text{cart}}$
\end_inset

,
 
\begin_inset Formula $v_{\text{cart}}$
\end_inset

 are the mass and horizontal velocity of the cart.
 Finally 
\begin_inset Formula $F$
\end_inset

 correspond to the force applied to the cart which is the action to be controlled to stabilize this dynamical system.
 
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
