\begin_layout Standard
In this context,
 the proposed approach treats speed recommendation as a control problem solved using Model Predictive Control (MPC) coupled with a continuously learning predictive model to handle uncertainty of the driving context,
 including the potentially non-stationary behavior of the human driver (cf.
