\begin_layout Standard
We introduced the CELL (Context Ensemble Local Learning) formalism and developed online learning algorithms that rely on ensembles of local expert agents.
 These agents self-organize according to social rules to continuously predict the evolution of the vehicle dynamics influenced by a human driver and other external factors.
 Chapter 
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
LatexCommand ref
reference "chap:Context-Ensemble-Local"
