 (WCET) and 
\emph on
bounded computational complexity
\emph default
 (ISO 26262 
\begin_inset CommandInset citation
LatexCommand cite
key "ISO26262-1"
literal "false"

\end_inset

).
 One of the primary advantages of the proposed architecture is that MPC allows the use of battle-tested industrial grade solvers (such as OSQP 
