LatexCommand cite
key "stellato2020osqp"
literal "false"

\end_inset

 or qpOASES 
\begin_inset CommandInset citation
LatexCommand cite
key "ferreau2014qpoases"
literal "false"

\end_inset

) that are compliant with these requirements.
 This ensures that the optimization process finishes within the strict real-time deadlines of embedded automotive hardware.
\end_layout

