\end_inset


\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
The previous section presented the architectural framework proposed in this thesis to address the speed recommendation problem.
 This section demonstrates how the specific theoretical and algorithmic contributions of this thesis directly address some of the industrial requirements listed in Section 
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
LatexCommand ref
reference "sec:Industrial-Requirements"
